WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:02,860
You went to find Lin Feng, right?

2
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:04,820
you forgot that day

3
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:06,260
How did he get taken away by us?

4
00:00:06,740 --> 00:00:07,740
You send it up now

5
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:08,980
He can give you a good look

6
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:10,380
He gave me fish to eat

7
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:12,220
This is a good look

8
00:00:15,990 --> 00:00:17,510
Sister Chen Yao, I have said it before

9
00:00:17,910 --> 00:00:19,910
Eating well is better than anything else on this island

10
00:00:20,350 --> 00:00:22,030
What else does Su Weiwei have besides lighters?

11
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:25,020
The days are getting more difficult day by day for Lin Feng.

12
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:26,900
There's meat, there's fire, there's salt

13
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:28,980
As long as you keep your head down, you can live

14
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:31,220
Is face really more important than survival?

15
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:33,790
Aren't you afraid that Su Weiwei will know?

16
00:00:34,190 --> 00:00:35,110
So what if you know

17
00:00:35,760 --> 00:00:38,840
Whether he can beat me or starve to death, I don’t care.

18
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:42,720
He can hardly hold it anymore. Lin Feng gives you a taste.

19
00:00:47,180 --> 00:00:49,500
He doesn’t even look at the 1.3 million yuan necklace.

20
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:51,360
This banana

21
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:53,100
What did you get in exchange for it?

22
00:00:53,260 --> 00:00:54,300
on this island

23
00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:55,820
Business is worthless

24
00:00:56,490 --> 00:00:57,890
Really tradeable

25
00:00:58,090 --> 00:00:59,410
Only loyalty and labor

26
00:00:59,570 --> 00:01:01,210
As long as you can prove your worth

27
00:01:01,820 --> 00:01:06,690
You can get physical sound

28
00:01:07,530 --> 00:01:08,530
give me some time

29
00:01:09,230 --> 00:01:10,150
let me think again

30
00:01:10,230 --> 00:01:12,030
Sister Chen Yao, think about it slowly

31
00:01:13,370 --> 00:01:22,860
But the real thing doesn’t wait until someone becomes it.

32
00:01:24,260 --> 00:01:25,340
Still missing a fire
